<title>THAILAND: TABLE-Thai June M-2 money supply up 14.2 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Thai June M-2 money supply up 14.2 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's M-2 money supply rose an estimated 14.2 percent year on year in June against a revised 10.7 percent growth in May, the Bank of Thailand said on Thursday.</p>
<p>It said the M-2 supply figure rose to an estimated 4.04 trillion baht in June from 3.89 trillion in May.</p>
<p>    M-2			 June 97	   May 97	June 96</p>
<p>    Money supply		4.04	     3.89	   3.54</p>
<p>    Percentage change	 14.2	     10.7	   16.9</p>
<p>Note - Money supply figures are in trillions of baht.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662)-6520642</p>
</text>
